---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`${SITE.name} publishes general technical information. This page explains the limits of that information and how advertising and affiliate links are handled.`}
  updated={SITE.legalUpdated}
>
  <h2>Information only</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on {SITE.name} is published for general information and education. We test what we write, but software,
    prices and free-tier limits change often. Verify details against official documentation before relying on them,
    especially for production systems, security and billing decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>Nothing here is legal, financial, security or career advice for your specific situation. Consult a qualified professional where it matters.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The site displays advertisements served by Google AdSense and possibly other networks. Advertisers do not influence
    our editorial content, and the presence of an advertisement is not an endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some articles may contain affiliate links. If you buy through such a link we may earn a commission at no extra cost
    to you. Articles that contain affiliate links say so near the top. We only link to products we have used or tested.
  </p>

  <h2>Sponsored content</h2>
  <p>We do not currently publish sponsored articles. If we ever do, they will be clearly labelled "Sponsored" at the top.</p>

  <h2>Community content</h2>
  <p>Articles and comments by community writers express their authors' views, not ours. They pass our moderation checks but we cannot guarantee their accuracy.</p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>We link to other sites for reference. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content or practices.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this page: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
